---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

const pageTitle = 'About 48 Hours in California';
const pageDescription =
  '48 Hours in California creates practical two-day itineraries for discovering California without spending hours planning the trip.';
---

<Base title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section>
    <p>About 48 Hours in California</p>

    <h1>Great California getaways don't have to take a week.</h1>

    <p>
      48 Hours in California is built around a simple idea: two days can be
      enough time to discover somewhere memorable.
    </p>

    <p>
      California gives us an extraordinary range of places to explore—from
      coastal towns and wine country to mountain communities, deserts, small
      towns, and cities. Our goal is to turn those possibilities into
      practical, easy-to-follow 48-hour getaways.
    </p>

    <h2>We do the planning so you can enjoy the trip.</h2>

    <p>
      Our guides focus on the questions travelers actually need answered:
      where to stay, what to see, where to eat, what is worth your time,
      and how to fit it together into one enjoyable weekend.
    </p>

    <p>
      We favor realistic itineraries over exhausting checklists. The goal
      isn't to see everything. It's to make the most of the 48 hours you have.
    </p>

    <a href="/itineraries/">Explore 48-Hour Getaways</a>
  </section>
</Base>
